# Draft PRs = no checks

| State | Actions | Vercel |
|-------|---------|--------|
| **draft** | Skipped (`ci.yml` `if`) | Ignore cancela feature deploy (ambos proyectos) |
| **ready** | lint/typecheck + `vercel-preview` (Actions) | Git feature preview cancelado (ignore); URL en job `vercel-preview` |
| push `development` | Runs | Preview on prod (SSO) + `rocha-cotizador-dev` Production pública |
| push `main` | CI + Deploy workflow | Auto-deploy off; Actions ships prod |

## Agent

- Always `gh pr create --draft` unless user says otherwise in that message
- Never `gh pr ready` / undraft unless user ordered it
- Draft: do not wait on `gh pr checks` (skipped on purpose)
- Ready: wait `gh pr checks` — `lint-and-typecheck` + `vercel-preview` (ignore Vercel Git cancel en feature PRs)
- No branch-only `deploymentEnabled` hacks (`**` true; draft gate = ignore script)

Refs: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `.github/workflows/preview-on-ready.yml`, `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`, `scripts/vercel-ignore-draft-pr.sh`, `docs/ci.md`
